 <p data-type="body">The existing structure was designed for a specific purpose. A tenancy fitout that changes the loads, even in ways that seem minor, needs to be checked against that original design. If the original drawings aren’t available, which is common in older buildings, the existing structure needs to be assessed before anything can be confirmed.</p>
