 <p data-type="body">At Structure, we don’t treat engineering as a box to be ticked. We treat it as a creative force in the design process. Where others default to what can’t be done, we work out how. Where others focus on constraints, we look for opportunities. The result is structural solutions that are efficient, elegant, and buildable — designs that flow seamlessly from concept to construction.</p>
 <p data-type="body">We also know that good engineering pays for itself. Our meticulous process and thorough documentation reduce variations, limit redesigns, and minimise costly surprises on site. Structure may not always be the lowest fee on paper, but we’re often the most economical outcome in reality.</p>
